{"4490850": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "White Mask Mansion", "steam_appid": 4490850, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5105710, 5038480], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are looking for your missing sister in a big house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0c37b2d60f6c009de9ddb7608e18140b.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0c37b2d60f6c009de9ddb7608e18140b.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0c37b2d60f6c009de9ddb7608e18140b.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are hunted by a stalker enemy in the vein of Alien Isolation, Resident Evil and Outlast. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0b154b28ff0b171702dcd7516d32684f.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0b154b28ff0b171702dcd7516d32684f.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0b154b28ff0b171702dcd7516d32684f.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have to use hide and seek mechanics to avoid detection which means certain death.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/d1523375647e685d78eea79327088267.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/d1523375647e685d78eea79327088267.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/d1523375647e685d78eea79327088267.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/b0cec31e8c7005411cc21cf8543568db.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/b0cec31e8c7005411cc21cf8543568db.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/b0cec31e8c7005411cc21cf8543568db.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also sneak to make it harder for the stalker to find you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0717841946fcd99c3602c11d5ead1736.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0717841946fcd99c3602c11d5ead1736.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0717841946fcd99c3602c11d5ead1736.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the keys needed to progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/f6fddd064d942cc67acf324d056da599.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/f6fddd064d942cc67acf324d056da599.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/f6fddd064d942cc67acf324d056da599.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reach the final area.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/622528b80327c7943f2d5ecb819d32bb.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/622528b80327c7943f2d5ecb819d32bb.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/622528b80327c7943f2d5ecb819d32bb.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/bef56b23509fdcfbd9e17eefb02a3867.avif?t=1788202487\" width=460 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 3D action-adventure horror game with randomization mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is a highly replayable single player experience in which you try to escape the titular White Mask Mansion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A minimum of a couple of hours of gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The stalker is always hunting (stalker mechanics)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Random key placement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomized spawn</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No checkpoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run can unfold differently</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide and seek mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Basic sneak mechanics (this is not Hitman or Thief)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival horror style progression (gathering keys to open doors)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a mystery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dramatic ending crescendo</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore lore (replay to gather lore)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rich soundscape and music</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete against others indirectly (steam leaderboards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam achievements (achievement hunting)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No save scumming (either survive or die)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay to improve time elapsed </p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are looking for your missing sister in a big house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0c37b2d60f6c009de9ddb7608e18140b.poster.avif?t=1788202487\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0c37b2d60f6c009de9ddb7608e18140b.webm?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4490850/extras/0c37b2d60f6c009de9ddb7608e18140b.mp4?t=1788202487\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >